    {
      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Five words before we start. Claude dot ai: the chat window — one turn at a time, you decide what happens between turns. Claude Code: a terminal loop that gathers, acts on disk, verifies, and reports back — many turns per reply. Agentic loop: gather, act, verify, repeat — autonomously, before it stops to talk. Calibration: the first session, spent finding out what Claude sees, not what it can build. The five questions: files, purpose, would change, would not change, uncertain.",
